"Cast provides the Command Line Interface (CLI) for starknet, while Forge "
"addresses testing. Written in Rust, Cast utilizes starknet Rust and "
"integrates with Scarb. This integration allows for argument specification in "
"`Scarb.toml`, streamlining the process."
