#: src/ch02-08-01-deployment-script.md:205
msgid ""
"For greater flexibility, consider moving hardcoded values like accounts or "
"contract names to a configuration file. This approach simplifies updates and "
"overall management."
msgstr ""

#: src/ch02-09-starknet-js.md:3
msgid ""
"Starknet.js is a JavaScript/TypeScript library designed to connect your "
"website or decentralized application (D-App) to Starknet. It aims to mimic "
"the architecture of [ethers.js](https://docs.ethers.org/v5/), so if you are "
"familiar with ethers, you should find Starknet.js easy to work with."
msgstr ""

#: src/ch02-09-starknet-js.md:11
msgid "Starknet-js in your dapp"
msgstr ""

#: src/ch02-09-starknet-js.md:15
