#: src/ch02-15-03-thoth.md:3
msgid ""
"[Thoth](https://github.com/FuzzingLabs/thoth) (pronounced \"taut\" or "
"\"toss\") is a security toolkit for Cairo/Starknet. Written in Python 3, it "
"includes analyzers, disassemblers, and decompilers. Thoth is capable of "
"generating call graphs, control-flow graphs (CFG), and data-flow graphs for "
"Sierra files or Cairo/Starknet compilation artifacts. It also features tools "
"like a symbolic execution engine and a symbolic bounded model checker."
msgstr ""

