"local compilations."
msgstr ""

#: src/ch02-15-03-thoth.md:8
msgid ""
"**Decompiler**: Transforms assembly into decompiled code using SSA (Static "
"Single Assignment)."
msgstr ""

#: src/ch02-15-03-thoth.md:9
msgid "**Call Flow Analysis**: Generates Call Flow Graphs."
msgstr ""

#: src/ch02-15-03-thoth.md:10
msgid ""
"**Static Analysis**: Conducts various types of analyses "
"(security/optimization/analytics) on contracts."
msgstr ""

#: src/ch02-15-03-thoth.md:11
msgid ""
"**Symbolic Execution**: Finds variable values for specific paths in "
"functions and generates test cases."
msgstr ""

#: src/ch02-15-03-thoth.md:12
msgid ""
"**Data Flow Analysis**: Produces Data Flow Graphs (DFG) for each function."
msgstr ""

#: src/ch02-15-03-thoth.md:13
msgid "**Disassembler**: Converts bytecode to assembly."
msgstr ""

#: src/ch02-15-03-thoth.md:14
msgid "**Control Flow Analysis**: Creates Control Flow Graphs (CFG)."
msgstr ""

#: src/ch02-15-03-thoth.md:15
msgid "**Cairo Fuzzer Inputs**: Generates inputs for Cairo fuzzer."
