#: src/ch04-01-accounts.md:5
msgid "Account Contract Interface"
msgstr ""

#: src/ch04-01-accounts.md:7
msgid ""
"Account contracts, being a type of smart contracts, are distinguished by "
"specific methods. A smart contract becomes an account contract when it "
"follows the public interface outlined in SNIP-6 ([Starknet Improvement "
"Proposal-6: Standard Account "
"Interface](https://github.com/ericnordelo/SNIPs/blob/feat/standard-account/SNIPS/snip-6.md)). "
"This standard draws inspiration from SRC-6 and SRC-5, similar to Ethereum's "
"ERCs, which establish application conventions and contract standards."
msgstr ""

#: src/ch04-01-accounts.md:10
msgid ""
