msgid ""
"The `__execute__` function calls the `call_contract_syscall` function from "
"the `starknet` module. This function executes the call and returns the "
"result. The `call_contract_syscall` function is a Starknet syscall, which "
"means that it is executed by the Starknet protocol. The Starknet protocol is "
"responsible for executing the call and returning the result. The Starknet "
"protocol will also validate the call, so we do not need to validate the call "
"in the `__execute__` function."
